{{>header}}





<main class="container">
 <section class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h1>Help Save Warp Zone<br>Support Louisville Makes Games Now!</h1>
      <p class="lead-text">
        Warp Zone, the heart of Louisville’s game developer community, must vacate its longtime home by October 31, 2025. Louisville Makes Games (LMG) powers this creative hub with free events, workshops, and collaboration for local creators. Your support is critical to secure a new space and keep this vibrant community thriving.
      </p>
      <p>
        Join the Louisville Makes Games Fund today to protect Louisville’s game development future.
      </p>
    </div>
<div class="col-md-6">

   {{> fund-donation-box}}

   </div>
  </section>

  {{> fund-contributors}}

  <section class="container mb-5">
    <h1 class="mb-3">Corporate Sponsorships</h1>
    <p>
      Louisville Makes Games and Warp Zone rely on generous corporate sponsors to support our mission of fostering creativity, education, and collaboration within the local game development community.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sponsorship funds help maintain our coworking space, host free workshops and events, provide resources for artists and developers, and promote Louisville’s growing game creator scene.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Sponsor Benefits</h2>
    <ul class="mb-3 ps-3">
      <li>Your logo and website link featured prominently on our site and Warp Zone space</li>
      <li>Regular updates on community projects and impact reports</li>
      <li>Opportunities to collaborate on initiatives and engage with local creatives</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5">Sponsorship Tiers</h2>
  {{> fund-corp-tiers-table}}

    <p><em>Your contributions are considered charitable donations (tax-free gifts to Louisville Makes Games, Inc.)</em></p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      To discuss sponsorship options or custom partnerships, please contact us at
      <a href="mailto:directors@louisvillemakesgames.org">directors@louisvillemakesgames.org</a>.
    </p>
  </section>


